#: ../../../src/changes/2026/r001.md:12
msgid ""
"This is the last 25.05 Platform release including regular NixOS software "
"updates from the upstream distribution. Please consider updating to "
"Platform 25.11. Security updates will only be performed for selected "
"packages with a high impact and an (even indirect) remote vector, for a "
"limited period."
msgstr ""

